{"doc_id":"official_openai_image_refs_001","source_id":"openai_image_generation_docs","source_url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation","source_title":"OpenAI image references","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"openai","model_ids":["gpt-image-2","gpt-image-1.5","gpt-image-1"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"openai-docs-terms-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0001","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["reference_images","image_editing","consistency"],"content":"OpenAI Image API 支持用一张或多张输入图作为参考来生成或编辑新图。Prompt Agent 应把每张参考图的用途写清楚，例如主体身份、产品、背景、构图或局部编辑区域，避免把多张图的角色混在同一句里。","summary":"OpenAI 多参考图要明确每张图的角色和用途。","rules":[{"rule_id":"openai_label_reference_images","rule_type":"do","text":"多参考图请求中，为每张图标注角色、用途和不可混淆边界。","confidence":0.9},{"rule_id":"openai_avoid_reference_role_blend","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要只写“参考这些图”，应说明哪张图控制人物、产品、背景或构图。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_openai_image_refs_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_openai_image_masks_001","source_id":"openai_image_generation_docs","source_url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation","source_title":"OpenAI image mask requirements","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"openai","model_ids":["gpt-image-2","gpt-image-1.5","gpt-image-1"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"openai-docs-terms-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0002","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["image_editing","mask","input_requirements"],"content":"OpenAI 图片局部编辑需要输入图和 mask 在格式与尺寸上匹配，mask 还要带 alpha 通道。Prompt Agent 遇到局部替换需求时，应提醒用户提供明确编辑区域，而不是只靠文字描述让模型猜范围。","summary":"局部编辑 mask 需要同尺寸、同格式和 alpha 通道。","rules":[{"rule_id":"openai_mask_same_size_alpha","rule_type":"do","text":"局部编辑前检查 mask 与原图尺寸/格式一致并含 alpha 通道。","confidence":0.92},{"rule_id":"openai_mask_scope_prompt","rule_type":"do","text":"在 prompt 中同步说明 mask 区域要替换什么、保留什么。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_openai_image_masks_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_openai_image_output_params_001","source_id":"openai_image_generation_docs","source_url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation","source_title":"OpenAI image output options","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"openai","model_ids":["gpt-image-2","gpt-image-1.5","gpt-image-1"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"openai-docs-terms-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0003","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["aspect_ratio","quality","output_format","cost_latency"],"content":"OpenAI 图像生成的大小、质量、格式、压缩和背景是请求参数，不应只埋在自然语言 prompt 中。低质量适合草稿和快速迭代，高质量适合最终资产。","summary":"图像大小、质量和格式应作为参数明确设置。","rules":[{"rule_id":"openai_surface_output_params","rule_type":"do","text":"把尺寸、质量、格式和背景从 prompt 中抽到可审计参数里。","confidence":0.88},{"rule_id":"openai_quality_by_workflow_stage","rule_type":"do","text":"草稿用低质量快速验证，最终图再升到中高质量。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_openai_image_output_params_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_openai_image_limitations_001","source_id":"openai_image_generation_docs","source_url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation","source_title":"OpenAI image limitations","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"openai","model_ids":["gpt-image-2","gpt-image-1.5","gpt-image-1"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"openai-docs-terms-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0004","chunk_type":"failure_mode","tags":["text_rendering","composition","consistency","failure_avoidance"],"content":"OpenAI 文档提示图像模型仍可能在精确文字摆放、复现角色/品牌一致性和布局敏感构图上出错。Prompt Agent 应把这些作为审阅风险，要求关键文字、logo 和产品位置有明确约束，并建议生成后检查。","summary":"文字、品牌一致性和布局位置是图像 prompt 的高风险项。","rules":[{"rule_id":"openai_check_text_layout_risk","rule_type":"do","text":"有文字或 logo 时，明确内容、位置、对比度和不要改字。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"openai_warn_consistency_risk","rule_type":"do","text":"递归人物或品牌资产时提示一致性风险，建议用参考图和版本记录。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_openai_image_limitations_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_openai_revised_prompt_001","source_id":"openai_image_generation_docs","source_url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation","source_title":"OpenAI revised prompt audit","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"openai","model_ids":["gpt-image-2","gpt-image-1.5","gpt-image-1"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"openai-docs-terms-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0005","chunk_type":"audit","tags":["revised_prompt","audit","prompt_versions"],"content":"OpenAI Responses API 的图像生成工具可能返回 revised_prompt。Prompt Agent 应把用户原文、优化稿、模型 revised_prompt 和最终输出分开记录，避免后续无法解释结果来自哪一版提示词。","summary":"记录 revised_prompt 便于追踪模型实际使用的提示词。","rules":[{"rule_id":"openai_store_revised_prompt","rule_type":"do","text":"保存 original_prompt、agent_revised_prompt 和 provider_revised_prompt 三层记录。","confidence":0.87}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_openai_revised_prompt_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_openai_cookbook_image_prompt_001","source_id":"openai_gpt_image_prompting_cookbook","source_url":"https://developers.openai.com/cookbook/examples/multimodal/image-gen-1.5-prompting_guide","source_title":"OpenAI GPT Image prompting patterns","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"openai","model_ids":["gpt-image-1.5","gpt-image-2"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"openai-cookbook-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0006","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["composition","lighting","style","prompt_structure"],"content":"OpenAI 图像提示词更适合完整自然语言，清楚写主体、场景、构图、光线、材质、风格和交付目的。相同信息如果散成关键词堆，批注时应改成可读的制作说明。","summary":"OpenAI 图像 prompt 应用自然语言描述可控视觉要素。","rules":[{"rule_id":"openai_image_complete_visual_brief","rule_type":"do","text":"用完整句描述主体、构图、光线、材质、风格和交付目的。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"openai_reduce_keyword_soup","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要把互相冲突的风格关键词堆在一起。","confidence":0.78}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_openai_cookbook_image_prompt_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_gemini_image_specificity_001","source_id":"google_gemini_image_docs","source_url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation","source_title":"Gemini image specificity","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"gemini","model_ids":["gemini-3-pro-image","gemini-2.5-flash-image"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0007","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["prompt_structure","composition","style"],"content":"Gemini 图像最佳实践强调越具体越可控。Prompt Agent 应把泛泛的“好看/高级/真实”改成具体的主体、材质、构图、镜头、色彩和文字位置。","summary":"Gemini 图像 prompt 要把抽象形容词改成可见细节。","rules":[{"rule_id":"gemini_be_hyper_specific","rule_type":"do","text":"把抽象目标翻译成可见的主体、材质、构图、镜头和色彩。","confidence":0.88}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_gemini_image_specificity_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_gemini_image_intent_001","source_id":"google_gemini_image_docs","source_url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation","source_title":"Gemini image context and intent","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"gemini","model_ids":["gemini-3-pro-image","gemini-2.5-flash-image"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0008","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["intent","brand","use_case"],"content":"Gemini 图像提示词应说明用途和上下文，例如广告、产品图、logo、封面或信息图。用途会影响布局、清晰度和风格选择，因此 Prompt Agent 不应只优化画面描述。","summary":"说明图像用途能改善布局和风格选择。","rules":[{"rule_id":"gemini_add_context_and_intent","rule_type":"do","text":"为图像 prompt 补充用途、受众、投放渠道和关键约束。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_gemini_image_intent_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_gemini_image_iterate_001","source_id":"google_gemini_image_docs","source_url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation","source_title":"Gemini iterative editing","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"gemini","model_ids":["gemini-3-pro-image","gemini-2.5-flash-image"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0009","chunk_type":"workflow","tags":["image_editing","iteration","prompt_versions"],"content":"Gemini 图像文档建议通过多轮小改来细化结果。Prompt Agent 保存版本时应把“保持不变”和“只改某处”显式写出，避免下一轮把已满意的构图或身份也重绘。","summary":"多轮编辑要写清保持项和局部改动。","rules":[{"rule_id":"gemini_iterate_with_keep_constraints","rule_type":"do","text":"二次编辑时先列出保持不变的主体、构图、产品和背景，再写局部修改。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_gemini_image_iterate_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_gemini_image_steps_001","source_id":"google_gemini_image_docs","source_url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation","source_title":"Gemini step-by-step image prompting","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"gemini","model_ids":["gemini-3-pro-image","gemini-2.5-flash-image"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0010","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["prompt_structure","composition","complex_scene"],"content":"复杂 Gemini 图像场景应拆成步骤或层次：先背景，再前景主体，再关键物体和文本。Prompt Agent 遇到多主体、多产品或信息图时，应把场景拆成有顺序的构图指令。","summary":"复杂图像用分层步骤降低主体混淆。","rules":[{"rule_id":"gemini_step_by_step_complex_scene","rule_type":"do","text":"复杂场景按背景、主体、物体、文字、风格的顺序组织。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_gemini_image_steps_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_gemini_semantic_negative_001","source_id":"google_gemini_image_docs","source_url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation","source_title":"Gemini semantic negatives","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["image"],"provider":"gemini","model_ids":["gemini-3-pro-image","gemini-2.5-flash-image"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0011","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["negative_prompt","positive_constraints","failure_avoidance"],"content":"Gemini 图像最佳实践建议用语义化正向约束表达不要出现的东西，例如描述“空旷街道、无交通痕迹”，而不是只写“No cars”。Prompt Agent 应把生硬禁止词转成目标状态。","summary":"Gemini 图像负向约束优先转成正向目标状态。","rules":[{"rule_id":"gemini_semantic_negative_prompt","rule_type":"do","text":"把“不要 X”改写成画面应该呈现的可见状态。","confidence":0.85}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_gemini_semantic_negative_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_prompt_anatomy_001","source_id":"google_veo_prompt_guide","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/video-gen-prompt-guide","source_title":"Veo prompt anatomy","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0012","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["prompt_structure","subject","motion","camera","lighting"],"content":"Veo prompt 应拆成主体、动作、场景/上下文、镜头角度、镜头运动、光线、情绪、艺术风格、氛围、时间元素和音频。Prompt Agent 批注时应检查这些要素是否缺失或互相冲突。","summary":"Veo 视频 prompt 用主体、动作、场景、镜头、风格和音频组成。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_check_prompt_components","rule_type":"do","text":"检查 Veo prompt 是否包含主体、动作、场景、镜头、光线、风格和时间/音频约束。","confidence":0.9}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_prompt_anatomy_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_camera_motion_001","source_id":"google_veo_prompt_guide","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/video-gen-prompt-guide","source_title":"Veo camera and motion","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0013","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["camera","motion","stability"],"content":"Veo 支持描述镜头角度和镜头运动，但高级镜头、复杂运动或多个运动目标可靠性会变化。Prompt Agent 应避免同一短片里同时要求推拉摇移、主体大动作和复杂环境变化。","summary":"Veo 镜头运动要明确且克制，避免多重运动冲突。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_limit_camera_motion_stack","rule_type":"dont","text":"短视频中不要叠加多个镜头运动和多个大幅主体动作。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"veo_camera_stability_when_needed","rule_type":"do","text":"需要口播或产品稳定时，明确 static shot / fixed camera / no reframing。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_camera_motion_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_audio_prompt_001","source_id":"google_veo_prompt_guide","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/video-gen-prompt-guide","source_title":"Veo audio prompting","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.0-generate-001","veo-3.1-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0014","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["audio","dialogue","tts","lipsync"],"content":"Veo 3 系列可用音频提示指导声效、环境声和对白。Prompt Agent 应把音频要求放在独立句子里；如果 OpenCrew 下游会用 TTS/lipsync 替换声音，则画面 prompt 不应承诺最终朗读质量。","summary":"Veo 音频提示要独立描述，并和 TTS/lipsync 责任边界分清。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_audio_separate_sentence","rule_type":"do","text":"把声效、环境声、对白或旁白写成独立音频句子。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"veo_audio_boundary_with_tts","rule_type":"dont","text":"当下游 TTS 接管声音时，不要在视频画面 prompt 中承诺最终朗读字幕。","confidence":0.88}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_audio_prompt_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_negative_prompt_001","source_id":"google_veo_prompt_guide","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/video-gen-prompt-guide","source_title":"Veo negative prompts","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0015","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["negative_prompt","failure_avoidance"],"content":"Veo 负向提示词应列出不想看到的元素，而不是用“No/Don't”这类指令句。Prompt Agent 应把“不要字幕、不要水印”整理成 negative_prompt 字段里的元素列表。","summary":"Veo negative prompt 用元素列表，不用指令句。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_negative_as_elements","rule_type":"do","text":"把负向项写成元素列表，如 subtitles, watermark, extra hands, jitter。","confidence":0.9},{"rule_id":"veo_avoid_no_dont_negative","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要把 negative prompt 写成 no/don't 开头的自然语言命令。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_negative_prompt_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_short_single_scene_001","source_id":"google_veo_best_practices","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/best-practice","source_title":"Veo short video single scene","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0016","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["motion","scene","short_video"],"content":"Veo 最佳实践建议短视频聚焦单一场景。Prompt Agent 遇到 4 到 8 秒视频却包含多场景、多转场、多剧情时，应拆分成多个片段或收敛成一个动作目标。","summary":"短视频 prompt 应聚焦一个场景和一个主要动作。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_focus_short_clip_single_scene","rule_type":"do","text":"4-8 秒视频只保留一个主要场景和一个主动作。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"veo_split_multi_scene_story","rule_type":"do","text":"多场景叙事改成分镜列表，不塞进一个生成请求。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_short_single_scene_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_speech_quotes_001","source_id":"google_veo_best_practices","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/best-practice","source_title":"Veo speech formatting","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0017","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["dialogue","subtitles","text_rendering"],"content":"Veo 最佳实践建议为避免模型把对白渲染成画面文字，人物说话时用冒号引出内容，并避免引号。Prompt Agent 处理对白视频时应同时禁止字幕、标题、浮动文字和屏幕文字。","summary":"Veo 对白避免引号，防止台词被画成字幕文字。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_speech_colon_no_quotes","rule_type":"do","text":"对白格式用“人物 says: 台词”，避免把台词放进引号。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"veo_forbid_subtitle_artifacts","rule_type":"do","text":"口播视频同时加入 subtitles/title/on-screen text 的负向项。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_speech_quotes_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_first_last_frame_001","source_id":"google_veo_reference_images","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/generate-videos-from-an-image","source_title":"Veo first and last frames","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0018","chunk_type":"workflow","tags":["reference_images","first_frame","last_frame","i2v"],"content":"Veo 图生视频使用 Start 图作为首帧，并可选 End 图作为尾帧。Prompt Agent 应把首帧和尾帧写成时间锚点，说明中间发生什么，不要把尾帧当成普通风格参考。","summary":"Veo 首帧/尾帧是时间锚点，不是泛化参考图。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_start_end_frame_roles","rule_type":"do","text":"把 Start image 写成起始状态，End image 写成结束状态，中间只描述过渡动作。","confidence":0.88}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_first_last_frame_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_reference_images_001","source_id":"google_veo_reference_images","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/use-reference-images-to-guide-video-generation","source_title":"Veo subject and asset reference images","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0019","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["reference_images","subject_reference","asset_reference","consistency"],"content":"Veo reference-to-video 可使用 subject 或 asset 参考图。Prompt Agent 应分别标注人物/产品/物体参考，并说明哪些视觉属性要保持，不要让模型把产品参考当人物身份或把风格图当首帧。","summary":"Veo reference images 要区分 subject、asset、style 和 frame。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_reference_type_labels","rule_type":"do","text":"为每张参考图标注 subject、asset、style、first_frame 或 last_frame。","confidence":0.88},{"rule_id":"veo_reference_preserve_attributes","rule_type":"do","text":"说明参考图中要保持的身份、产品结构、材质、颜色或 logo。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_reference_images_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_veo_i2v_motion_only_001","source_id":"google_veo_best_practices","source_url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/video/best-practice","source_title":"Veo image-to-video motion-only guidance","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"veo","model_ids":["veo-3.1-generate-001","veo-3.0-generate-001"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"google-developers-cc-by-4.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0020","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["i2v","motion","camera","reference_images"],"content":"Veo 图生视频最佳实践强调使用高质量源图，并在 prompt 里主要描述运动。Prompt Agent 遇到 I2V 请求时，应少写重新设计画面，多写镜头、主体、环境的自然运动和稳定约束。","summary":"Veo I2V prompt 应基于源图描述运动而不是重设画面。","rules":[{"rule_id":"veo_i2v_prompt_motion_only","rule_type":"do","text":"I2V 中保留源图外观，只描述主体动作、环境变化和镜头运动。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"veo_i2v_high_quality_source","rule_type":"do","text":"提示用户使用清晰、高质量、主体明确的源图。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_veo_i2v_motion_only_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_wan_prompt_extension_001","source_id":"wan_video_github","source_url":"https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2","source_title":"Wan prompt extension","source_type":"official_repo","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"wan","model_ids":["wan2.2-i2v-a14b","wan2.2-ti2v-5b"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"Apache-2.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0021","chunk_type":"workflow","tags":["prompt_extension","i2v","prompt_structure"],"content":"Wan2.2 README 建议启用 prompt extension 来补充细节并提升视频质量；T2V 和 I2V 分别可用文本模型和视觉语言模型扩展。Prompt Agent 可先生成短清晰原始意图，再让扩展器补视觉细节。","summary":"Wan 可用 prompt extension 扩写细节，但原始意图要先清晰。","rules":[{"rule_id":"wan_use_prompt_extension_for_detail","rule_type":"do","text":"为 Wan 先写清核心主体/动作/镜头，再用 prompt extension 补充细节。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"wan_keep_extension_auditable","rule_type":"do","text":"保存扩写前和扩写后的 prompt，避免无法追溯扩展器改动。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_wan_prompt_extension_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_wan_i2v_aspect_001","source_id":"wan_video_github","source_url":"https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2","source_title":"Wan I2V aspect behavior","source_type":"official_repo","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"wan","model_ids":["wan2.2-i2v-a14b"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"Apache-2.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0022","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["i2v","aspect_ratio","reference_images"],"content":"Wan2.2 I2V 的 size 表示生成视频面积，宽高比跟随输入图。Prompt Agent 不应在 prompt 里写与输入图矛盾的 9:16/16:9 画幅，除非上游已经裁好首帧。","summary":"Wan I2V 的宽高比跟随输入图，prompt 不要和首帧冲突。","rules":[{"rule_id":"wan_i2v_aspect_follows_image","rule_type":"do","text":"Wan I2V 前先确认首帧画幅符合目标平台。","confidence":0.88},{"rule_id":"wan_avoid_aspect_conflict","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要在 prompt 中写与输入图方向冲突的画幅要求。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_wan_i2v_aspect_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_wan_i2v_prompt_from_image_001","source_id":"wan_video_github","source_url":"https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2","source_title":"Wan I2V prompt from image","source_type":"official_repo","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"wan","model_ids":["wan2.2-i2v-a14b"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"Apache-2.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0023","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["i2v","first_frame","motion","camera"],"content":"Wan I2V 可以基于输入图和 prompt 生成，也可配合 prompt extension 从图像生成提示。Prompt Agent 应围绕首帧已经存在的主体，补充轻量动作、情绪、镜头和氛围，避免重新描述成另一张图。","summary":"Wan I2V prompt 应延续首帧，并控制动作幅度。","rules":[{"rule_id":"wan_i2v_extend_first_frame","rule_type":"do","text":"描述首帧之后的自然延续动作，而不是重绘场景。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"wan_i2v_stable_motion","rule_type":"do","text":"口播或产品镜头优先写低运动、镜头稳定和身份/产品不变。","confidence":0.88}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_wan_i2v_prompt_from_image_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_wan_flf_chinese_001","source_id":"wan_video_github","source_url":"https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.1","source_title":"Wan first-last frame Chinese prompts","source_type":"official_repo","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"wan","model_ids":["wan2.1-flf2v","wan2.7-i2v"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"Apache-2.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0024","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["first_frame","last_frame","language","i2v"],"content":"Wan2.1 README 对首尾帧生成注明训练主要基于中文文本视频对，推荐使用中文 prompt。Prompt Agent 适配 Wan 首尾帧时，应优先给中文版本，再按需要附英文。","summary":"Wan 首尾帧任务优先使用中文 prompt。","rules":[{"rule_id":"wan_flf_prefer_chinese_prompt","rule_type":"do","text":"Wan 首尾帧生成优先输出中文提示词，确保起止帧和过渡动作清楚。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_wan_flf_chinese_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_wan_ti2v_mode_001","source_id":"wan_video_github","source_url":"https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2","source_title":"Wan TI2V mode selection","source_type":"official_repo","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"wan","model_ids":["wan2.2-ti2v-5b"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"Apache-2.0-summary","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0025","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["i2v","t2v","mode_selection","resolution"],"content":"Wan2.2 TI2V-5B 可根据是否提供 image 参数在 T2V/I2V 间切换，并有固定的 720P 尺寸形态。Prompt Agent 应根据是否有首帧决定任务类型，避免把图片参考需求发成纯文生视频。","summary":"Wan TI2V 有图就是图生视频，无图就是文生视频。","rules":[{"rule_id":"wan_ti2v_select_mode_by_image","rule_type":"do","text":"有首帧时显式走 I2V；无首帧时才走 T2V。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_wan_ti2v_mode_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_seedance_multimodal_refs_001","source_id":"seedance_2_report","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.14148","source_title":"Seedance 2.0 multimodal references","source_type":"official_paper","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"seedance","model_ids":["bytedance/seedance-2.0","bytedance/seedance-2.0-fast"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"arxiv-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0026","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["reference_images","reference_videos","audio","multimodal"],"content":"Seedance 2.0 报告描述其支持文本、图片、音频和视频输入，并支持多模态内容参考。Prompt Agent 应为每类参考单独标注用途，尤其是图片负责外观、视频负责动作/镜头、音频负责节奏或声音。","summary":"Seedance 多模态参考要按图片、视频、音频分角色。","rules":[{"rule_id":"seedance_label_multimodal_refs","rule_type":"do","text":"分别标注 image/video/audio reference 的角色和不可混淆边界。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"seedance_avoid_ref_role_confusion","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要把视频参考中的动作、图片参考中的身份和音频参考中的声音写成同一个泛化参考。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_seedance_multimodal_refs_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_seedance_duration_audio_001","source_id":"seedance_2_report","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.14148","source_title":"Seedance 2.0 duration and audio-video","source_type":"official_paper","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"seedance","model_ids":["bytedance/seedance-2.0","bytedance/seedance-2.0-fast"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"arxiv-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0027","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["duration","audio","lipsync","tts"],"content":"Seedance 2.0 报告描述支持 4 到 15 秒直接音视频生成。Prompt Agent 应把长口播拆成多个片段，并区分 provider 原生音频与 OpenCrew 下游 TTS/lipsync 是否会替换。","summary":"Seedance 音视频生成适合 4-15 秒片段，长口播要拆段。","rules":[{"rule_id":"seedance_duration_bounds","rule_type":"do","text":"Seedance 视频 prompt 保持在短片段范围，长脚本拆分。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"seedance_audio_boundary","rule_type":"do","text":"说明原生音频是否保留，若后续替换则不要依赖 provider 读准全文。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_seedance_duration_audio_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_seedance_multishot_001","source_id":"seedance_1_report","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.09113","source_title":"Seedance 1.0 multi-shot prompting","source_type":"official_paper","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"seedance","model_ids":["seedance-1.0","bytedance/seedance-2.0"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"arxiv-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0028","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["multishot","storyboard","consistency"],"content":"Seedance 1.0 报告强调多镜头叙事一致性和多主体上下文中的指令遵循。Prompt Agent 可用分镜式短段描述，但应保持每段角色、产品和场景命名一致。","summary":"Seedance 多镜头 prompt 要保持角色和产品命名一致。","rules":[{"rule_id":"seedance_multishot_consistent_names","rule_type":"do","text":"多镜头生成中固定角色名、产品名、场景名和镜头顺序。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"seedance_shot_list_not_story_blob","rule_type":"do","text":"把多镜头需求写成 shot list，而不是一整段剧情散文。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_seedance_multishot_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_seedance_prompt_following_001","source_id":"seedance_1_report","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.09113","source_title":"Seedance prompt following and motion plausibility","source_type":"official_paper","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"seedance","model_ids":["seedance-1.0","bytedance/seedance-2.0"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"arxiv-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0029","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["motion","prompt_adherence","stability"],"content":"Seedance 报告把 prompt following、运动合理性和视觉质量作为关键目标。Prompt Agent 应把动作写成物理可行、时间可完成的短动作，避免在一个片段里要求复杂剧情和大幅运动。","summary":"Seedance prompt 动作要物理合理、可在时长内完成。","rules":[{"rule_id":"seedance_motion_plausible","rule_type":"do","text":"把动作限制为短时长内可完成的真实动作。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"seedance_avoid_overloaded_action","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要把多段剧情、多个地点和强动作塞进一个短片段。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_seedance_prompt_following_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_seedance_safety_ip_001","source_id":"seedance_2_report","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.14148","source_title":"Seedance safety and likeness boundary","source_type":"official_paper","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"seedance","model_ids":["bytedance/seedance-2.0"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"arxiv-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0030","chunk_type":"safety","tags":["safety","identity","copyright","likeness"],"content":"Seedance 2.0 公开资料强调多模态参考与编辑能力也带来肖像和版权边界。Prompt Agent 对真实名人、影视角色、品牌角色和未授权肖像应给出风险批注，并建议换成授权人物或抽象角色描述。","summary":"Seedance 真实肖像和版权角色要做风险批注。","rules":[{"rule_id":"seedance_flag_likeness_ip","rule_type":"do","text":"发现名人、影视角色或未授权肖像时标记高风险并建议改写。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_seedance_safety_ip_001"}
{"doc_id":"vendor_kling_i2v_structure_001","source_id":"kling_open_platform_docs","source_url":"https://kling.ai/document-api","source_title":"Kling image-to-video structure","source_type":"vendor_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"kling","model_ids":["kling-v2-5-turbo","kling-v3-omni"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0031","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["i2v","first_frame","reference_images","prompt_structure"],"content":"Kling 普通图生视频在 OpenCrew 已验证为首帧图加 prompt 的结构；非 Omni 任务不使用 Omni 引用语法。Prompt Agent 应把首帧作为唯一视觉来源，prompt 只描述首帧后的自然运动。","summary":"Kling 非 Omni I2V 用首帧图加 prompt，不用 Omni 引用语法。","rules":[{"rule_id":"kling_first_frame_as_visual_source","rule_type":"do","text":"Kling I2V 中把首帧定义为人物、产品、背景和构图的权威来源。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"kling_no_omni_refs_for_turbo","rule_type":"dont","text":"非 Omni Kling 不要写 <<<image_1>>> 或 <<<video_1>>> 引用语法。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"vendor_kling_i2v_structure_001"}
{"doc_id":"vendor_kling_negative_field_001","source_id":"kling_open_platform_docs","source_url":"https://kling.ai/document-api","source_title":"Kling negative prompt field","source_type":"vendor_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"kling","model_ids":["kling-v2-5-turbo"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0032","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["negative_prompt","api_payload","failure_avoidance"],"content":"Kling 普通图生视频在 OpenCrew 集成中有独立 negative_prompt 字段。Prompt Agent 应把字幕、水印、身份漂移、镜头漂移、手部畸形和产品变形整理到负向字段，不混在正向 prompt 末尾。","summary":"Kling negative_prompt 应作为独立字段管理。","rules":[{"rule_id":"kling_use_negative_field","rule_type":"do","text":"把 Kling 负向项放进 negative_prompt 字段。","confidence":0.86},{"rule_id":"kling_negative_failure_modes","rule_type":"do","text":"补充字幕、水印、身份漂移、镜头漂移、手部畸形、产品变形等负向项。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"vendor_kling_negative_field_001"}
{"doc_id":"vendor_kling_camera_lock_001","source_id":"kling_open_platform_docs","source_url":"https://kling.ai/document-api","source_title":"Kling locked camera for talking head","source_type":"vendor_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"kling","model_ids":["kling-v2-5-turbo","kling-v3-omni"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0033","chunk_type":"principle","tags":["camera","stability","talking_head","motion"],"content":"Kling 口播图生视频应锁定镜头、人物比例、背景和画面边缘。Prompt Agent 对口播或产品手持场景应默认加入固定机位和低运动约束，除非用户明确要动态镜头。","summary":"Kling 口播优先固定机位和低运动。","rules":[{"rule_id":"kling_talking_head_locked_camera","rule_type":"do","text":"为 Kling 口播补充 fixed camera、no reframing、no camera drift。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"kling_restrain_expression_mouth","rule_type":"do","text":"口播嘴型清楚但收敛，表情亲和但不要夸张。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"vendor_kling_camera_lock_001"}
{"doc_id":"vendor_kling_clean_frame_001","source_id":"kling_open_platform_docs","source_url":"https://kling.ai/document-api","source_title":"Kling clean frame and subtitle boundary","source_type":"vendor_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["video"],"provider":"kling","model_ids":["kling-v2-5-turbo","kling-v3-omni"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0034","chunk_type":"failure_mode","tags":["subtitles","text_rendering","audio","tts"],"content":"Kling 口播中的台词应只作为声音或口型出现，画面不要生成字幕、标题、UI、水印或浮动文字。Prompt Agent 应在正向约束和负向提示词里同时处理文字污染风险。","summary":"Kling 口播不要让台词变成屏幕文字。","rules":[{"rule_id":"kling_dialogue_not_visual_text","rule_type":"do","text":"说明对白只驱动声音/口型，不生成字幕或屏幕文字。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"kling_negative_text_artifacts","rule_type":"do","text":"把字幕、标题、生成文字、Logo、水印和 UI 加入负向项。","confidence":0.84}],"examples":[],"hash":"vendor_kling_clean_frame_001"}
{"doc_id":"vendor_kling_lipsync_boundary_001","source_id":"kling_open_platform_docs","source_url":"https://kling.ai/document-api","source_title":"Kling advanced lip sync boundary","source_type":"vendor_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["lipsync"],"provider":"kling_lipsync","model_ids":["kling-lipsync-advanced"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0035","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["lipsync","audio","face","input_requirements"],"content":"OpenCrew 的 Kling advanced lip-sync 先识别人脸，再用源视频和音频创建对嘴任务。Prompt Agent 应把对嘴需求拆成 source_video、driving_audio、face/person selection 和 timing，而不是写成自然语言生成提示词。","summary":"Kling 对嘴是视频+音频驱动，不是文本 prompt 驱动。","rules":[{"rule_id":"kling_lipsync_video_audio_inputs","rule_type":"do","text":"对嘴任务明确源视频、驱动音频、人脸选择和时长对齐。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"kling_lipsync_no_text_generation_prompt","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要要求 lipsync 模型自行朗读文本；先准备音频。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"vendor_kling_lipsync_boundary_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_heygen_avatar_fields_001","source_id":"heygen_create_video_docs","source_url":"https://developers.heygen.com/reference/create-video","source_title":"HeyGen avatar video fields","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["digital_human"],"provider":"heygen","model_ids":["avatar_iv","avatar_v"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0036","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["avatar","voice","script","digital_human"],"content":"HeyGen Create Video API 需要把 avatar_id、script 或 audio、voice_id/voice_settings、aspect_ratio、background、caption、output_format 和 engine 等字段拆开。Prompt Agent 不应把数字人需求压成一段自然语言。","summary":"HeyGen 数字人 prompt 要拆成 avatar、voice、script、画幅和背景字段。","rules":[{"rule_id":"heygen_split_avatar_voice_script","rule_type":"do","text":"把数字人需求拆成 avatar_id、script、voice_id/voice_settings、aspect_ratio、background 和 engine。","confidence":0.9}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_heygen_avatar_fields_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_heygen_script_audio_exclusion_001","source_id":"heygen_create_video_docs","source_url":"https://developers.heygen.com/reference/create-video","source_title":"HeyGen script or audio input","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["digital_human"],"provider":"heygen","model_ids":["avatar_iv","avatar_v"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0037","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["script","audio","voice","lipsync"],"content":"HeyGen Create Video 中 script 和 audio_url/audio_asset_id 互斥；script 需要 voice_id 或 avatar 默认声音，音频输入则用于对嘴。Prompt Agent 应先判断用户是要 TTS 生成脚本，还是已有音频驱动。","summary":"HeyGen script 和 audio 输入互斥，先判定驱动方式。","rules":[{"rule_id":"heygen_choose_script_or_audio","rule_type":"do","text":"数字人请求先选择 script+voice 或 audio_url/audio_asset_id 二选一。","confidence":0.9},{"rule_id":"heygen_no_script_audio_mix","rule_type":"dont","text":"不要同时填 script 和 audio_url/audio_asset_id。","confidence":0.9}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_heygen_script_audio_exclusion_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_heygen_motion_prompt_001","source_id":"heygen_create_video_docs","source_url":"https://developers.heygen.com/reference/create-video","source_title":"HeyGen motion prompt","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["digital_human"],"provider":"heygen","model_ids":["avatar_iv","avatar_v"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0038","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["motion","gesture","avatar"],"content":"HeyGen motion_prompt 用自然语言控制 avatar 身体动作和手势，但支持范围取决于 avatar 类型和 engine。Prompt Agent 应把脚本文案和动作提示分离，动作提示保持短、具体、可执行。","summary":"HeyGen motion_prompt 只控制动作手势，不替代脚本。","rules":[{"rule_id":"heygen_motion_prompt_separate","rule_type":"do","text":"把 motion_prompt 和 script 分开写，动作只描述姿态、手势和表演强度。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"heygen_motion_prompt_supported_avatar","rule_type":"do","text":"检查 avatar 类型和 engine 是否支持 motion_prompt。","confidence":0.82}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_heygen_motion_prompt_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_heygen_lipsync_inputs_001","source_id":"heygen_lipsync_docs","source_url":"https://developers.heygen.com/reference/create-lipsync","source_title":"HeyGen lipsync inputs","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["lipsync"],"provider":"heygen","model_ids":["speed","precision"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0039","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["lipsync","audio","video","input_requirements"],"content":"HeyGen Create Lipsync 使用 video 和 audio 两个资产输入，并替换源视频音频、重驱动说话人的口型。Prompt Agent 应把视频源、音频源、标题、回调和可选裁剪时间拆成字段。","summary":"HeyGen lipsync 核心输入是 video asset 和 audio asset。","rules":[{"rule_id":"heygen_lipsync_video_audio_assets","rule_type":"do","text":"HeyGen 对嘴请求必须明确 video 输入和 audio 输入。","confidence":0.9},{"rule_id":"heygen_lipsync_not_text_prompt","rule_type":"dont","text":"对嘴阶段不要只给 script 文本，应先有音频或走 Create Video script+voice。","confidence":0.88}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_heygen_lipsync_inputs_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_heygen_lipsync_modes_001","source_id":"heygen_lipsync_docs","source_url":"https://developers.heygen.com/reference/create-lipsync","source_title":"HeyGen lipsync modes","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["lipsync"],"provider":"heygen","model_ids":["speed","precision"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0040","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["lipsync","quality","mode"],"content":"HeyGen lipsync mode 可选 speed 或 precision。Prompt Agent 应把“快出样”和“高质量最终版”映射到不同 mode，并记录选择原因。","summary":"HeyGen lipsync speed 快，precision 质量高。","rules":[{"rule_id":"heygen_lipsync_mode_by_goal","rule_type":"do","text":"草稿/预览用 speed，最终质量优先用 precision。","confidence":0.86}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_heygen_lipsync_modes_001"}
{"doc_id":"official_heygen_lipsync_flags_001","source_id":"heygen_lipsync_docs","source_url":"https://developers.heygen.com/reference/create-lipsync","source_title":"HeyGen lipsync optional flags","source_type":"official_doc","trust_level":"official","model_family":["lipsync"],"provider":"heygen","model_ids":["speed","precision"],"language":"zh-CN","license":"vendor-docs-summary-only","captured_at":"2026-06-24T00:00:00Z","chunk_id":"chunk_0041","chunk_type":"constraint","tags":["lipsync","captions","speech_enhancement","duration"],"content":"HeyGen lipsync 支持字幕、动态时长、移除背景音乐、语音增强、水印、片段 start/end 和 fps_mode 等参数。Prompt Agent 应根据用户目标显式建议是否启用，而不是默认全部打开。","summary":"HeyGen lipsync 可选参数要按目标选择。","rules":[{"rule_id":"heygen_lipsync_choose_optional_flags","rule_type":"do","text":"按任务目标设置 caption、dynamic_duration、speech_enhancement、music removal 和 start/end。","confidence":0.84},{"rule_id":"heygen_lipsync_audit_no_secrets","rule_type":"dont","text":"对嘴审计中不要保存 API key、Authorization、cookie 或 signed URL token。","confidence":0.9}],"examples":[],"hash":"official_heygen_lipsync_flags_001"}
